{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a full-screen "destination hero slider" block. Build an exact static layout first.
    
    OVERALL
    - Full-bleed: width 100vw (break out of any page-width container with margin-left: calc(50% - 50vw)), height 100svh, min-height 640px, position relative, overflow hidden, background #111.
    - Scope all markup, CSS and JS to a wrapper with a unique id based on block.id, so multiple instances never clash. Use plain CSS and vanilla JS only, no libraries.
    - Accent colour setting (default #ECAB32). All text is white.
    
    LAYER 1 — BACKGROUND
    - The active slide's image covers the whole block (object-fit: cover).
    - Three overlays on top of it: (a) flat black at the "overlay opacity" setting (default 25%); (b) a left-to-right gradient from rgba(0,0,0,.40) to transparent at 55%, for text legibility; (c) a top gradient from rgba(0,0,0,.35) to transparent at 20%, so a transparent theme header stays readable.
    
    LAYER 2 — TOP AUTOPLAY BAR
    - A 3px bar pinned to the very top edge. The track is transparent and the fill uses the accent colour. Start the fill at 0% width (Part 2 animates it).
    
    LAYER 3 — LEFT CONTENT (active slide)
    Left padding 5vw. Absolutely positioned: the top sits at 35% of the section height, and the bottom of the button row lines up with the bottom edge of the cards (about 82% of the height). Stack, in order:
    1. A white dash, 20px × 3px, with 18px space below.
    2. The location eyebrow (e.g. "Switzerland Alps"): body font, clamp(15px, 1.4vw, 22px), weight 300, inside an overflow:hidden mask, with 14px space below.
    3. A two-line title. Put each line in its own span inside its own overflow:hidden mask (Part 2 needs this). Use the display font, UPPERCASE, tall condensed bold (default Oswald 700, font_picker handle oswald_n7), font-size clamp(52px, 7.2vw, 112px), line-height 1.02.
    4. A description: 14px, line-height 1.75, white at 75% opacity, max-width 390px, margin 18px 0 28px.
    5. A button row, gap 16px, vertically centred:
       - Bookmark: a 38px circle filled with the accent colour, holding a white 14px bookmark SVG. Clicking it toggles a "saved" state (icon filled or outlined), client-side only.
       - A "DISCOVER LOCATION" pill: 40px tall, padding 0 28px, transparent, 1px border rgba(255,255,255,.55), radius 999px, 11px uppercase, letter-spacing .12em, weight 500. On hover: white background, dark text. It links to the slide's button link., LAYER 4 — CARD TRACK (upcoming slides)
    - Positioned left: 41% and top: 42%. It runs off the right edge and the last visible card is cut off by the screen edge. That is intended.
    - Show every slide except the active one, in order after it, looping. Active 1 → cards 2,3,4,5,6. Active 3 → cards 4,5,6,1,2.
    - Each card is a <button>: width clamp(170px, 14.6vw, 240px), aspect-ratio 13/20, gap 1.9vw, border-radius 10px, overflow hidden, box-shadow 0 22px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.35). Image object-fit cover. Bottom overlay gradient from rgba(0,0,0,.65) to transparent at 55%.
    - Card text sits bottom-left with padding 0 16px 20px: a 12px × 2px white dash; the location at 12px, white 85%; the title on 2 lines, UPPERCASE display font, 21px, line-height 1.05.
    - On hover: translateY(-6px) and a deeper shadow, over 300ms.
    
    LAYER 5 — CONTROLS ROW
    - Vertical centre at 91% of the height. The left edge lines up with the first card (41%); the right edge is 4vw from the screen edge.
    - Prev and next arrows: 60px circles, 1px border rgba(255,255,255,.55), transparent, thin white chevron SVGs, gap 12px. On hover: white border and background rgba(255,255,255,.1).
    - A progress line fills the space between the arrows and the counter (margin 0 24px): a 1px line in rgba(255,255,255,.35) with a 2px accent fill on top. Fill width = activeIndex ÷ totalSlides, so slide 1 = 0% and slide 2 = 16.7% when there are 6 slides.
    - A counter on the right showing two digits ("01"): display font, clamp(36px, 3.6vw, 56px), inside an overflow:hidden box one line tall.
    
    SETTINGS
    Global: accent colour; display font (font_picker, default oswald_n7); overlay opacity (range 0–80, default 25); autoplay (checkbox, on); autoplay seconds (range 3–12, default 6); pause on hover (checkbox, on).
    Slides: 6 fixed groups with a header for each ("Slide 1" to "Slide 6"). Each group has: image (image_picker), location (text), title line 1 (text), title line 2 (text), description (textarea), button label (text, default "Discover location"), button link (url). Skip any slide without a title, so the block works with 2 to 6 slides. If a slide has no image, use a Shopify placeholder SVG on dark grey., DEMO CONTENT (defaults)
    1. Switzerland Alps — SAINT / ANTÖNIEN
    2. Japan Alps — NAGANO / PREFECTURE
    3. Sahara Desert - Morocco — MARRAKECH / MERZOUGA
    4. Sierra Nevada - United States — YOSEMITE / NATIONAL PARK
    5. Tarifa - Spain — LOS LANCES / BEACH
    6. Cappadocia - Turkey — GÖREME / VALLEY
    Use this description on all six: "Mauris malesuada nisi sit amet augue accumsan tincidunt. Maecenas tincidunt, velit ac porttitor pulvinar, tortor eros facilisis libero."
    
    RESPONSIVE
    - ≤1024px: cards clamp(150px, 18vw, 190px); the track starts at left 46%.
    - ≤749px: content top at 18%; title clamp(40px, 11vw, 56px); description max-width 90%. The card track moves under the content (left 5vw, bottom 120px), cards are 132px wide with a 12px gap, and the row scrolls horizontally with scroll-snap. The controls row sits at bottom 32px with 5vw side padding; arrows are 48px and the counter is 32px.
    
    IMAGES
    Each slide has one image, used for both its background and its card. Use image_url + image_tag with srcset (backgrounds up to 2400w, cards up to 600w). Load slide 1's background eagerly with fetchpriority="high". Lazy-load everything else.
    
    Render slide 1 as active. Prev, next and card clicks only need to swap content for now. , STATE
    - Track a single activeIndex and loop infinitely.
    - "Next" makes the first card the active slide. Clicking any card makes that card's slide active, and the expansion starts from that card's position.
    - Ignore input while a transition runs (about 1.3s).
    
    NEXT / CARD-CLICK TRANSITION (about 1.2s; easing cubic-bezier(.76,0,.24,1) unless stated)
    1. 0ms — The clicked card scales to 1.04 over 150ms.
    2. 0–650ms — The card grows into the new background:
       - Place a full-size layer holding the new slide's background image above the old background.
       - Start it with clip-path: inset(...) that matches the card's exact rect, measured with getBoundingClientRect relative to the section, with a 10px radius.
       - Animate the clip-path to inset(0 round 0). The image keeps its final full-screen framing and is revealed through a growing window. It also scales from 1.1 to 1.
       - Hide the real card the moment this starts.
    3. 0–650ms — The old scene darkens: the old background goes to filter: brightness(.25), and the old left text fades to 20% opacity in place without moving. A dark frame stays visible around the growing image.
    4. 650ms — The new image becomes the real background and the layer is removed. Swap in the new slide's text, hidden and ready to reveal.
    5. 60–750ms — The cards shift left by one slot, each lagging 80ms behind the card before it. The gaps briefly widen, then close up; this elastic-gap look is important. Each card moves for 600ms with cubic-bezier(.65,0,.35,1). The slide that just left the background is added as the last card: it fades in from translateX(40px), opacity 0 → 1, over 400ms, after the others settle.
    6. From 550ms — Text reveal: each element starts 90ms after the previous one and runs 600ms with cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1):
       - dash: scaleX 0 → 1, transform-origin left
       - eyebrow: translateY(105%) → 0 inside its mask
       - title line 1, then title line 2: translateY(105%) → 0 inside their masks, so the letters rise up from a hidden baseline
       - description: translateY(14px) → 0, opacity 0 → 1
       - button row: translateY(14px) → 0, opacity 0 → 1
    7. From 300ms — The counter rolls up: the old number goes from translateY(0) to -100% while the new one comes up from 100% to 0, both over 450ms.
    8. From 300ms — The progress line's accent fill animates to activeIndex ÷ total over 600ms.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign g = block.id | replace: '_', '' %}
{% style %}
#s-{{g}}{display:block;position:relative;width:100%;height:100svh;min-height:640px;overflow:hidden;background:#111;color:#fff}#s-{{g}} .bg,#s-{{g}} .grow{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}#s-{{g}} .grow{z-index:5;clip-path:inset(var(--t) var(--r) var(--b) var(--l) round 10px);transform:scale(1.1);transition:clip-path 650ms cubic-bezier(.76,0,.24,1),transform 650ms cubic-bezier(.76,0,.24,1)}#s-{{g}} .grow.open{clip-path:inset(0 round 0);transform:scale(1)}#s-{{g}} .shade{position:absolute;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,.25);z-index:1}#s-{{g}} .shade:after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#0006,transparent 55%),linear-gradient(#0006,transparent 20%)}#s-{{g}} .copy{position:absolute;z-index:2;left:5vw;top:35%;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;transition:opacity .65s}#s-{{g}} .copy.dim{opacity:.2}#s-{{g}} .dash{width:20px;height:3px;background:#fff;margin-bottom:18px;transform-origin:left}#s-{{g}} .loc,#s-{{g}} .line{display:block;overflow:hidden}#s-{{g}} .loc{font-size:clamp(15px,1.4vw,22px);margin-bottom:14px}#s-{{g}} h1{font:700 clamp(52px,7.2vw,112px)/1.02 Oswald,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0}#s-{{g}} .desc{max-width:390px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#fffd;margin:18px 0 28px}#s-{{g}} .actions{display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:center}#s-{{g}} .link{border:1px solid #ffffff8c;border-radius:99px;padding:12px 28px;color:white;text-decoration:none;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em}#s-{{g}} .cards{position:absolute;z-index:3;left:41%;top:42%;display:flex;gap:1.9vw}#s-{{g}} .card{position:relative;flex:0 0 clamp(170px,14.6vw,240px);aspect-ratio:13/20;overflow:hidden;border:0;border-radius:10px;background:#333;color:white;padding:0;box-shadow:0 22px 40px #0006;transition:transform 600ms cubic-bezier(.65,0,.35,1),opacity 400ms}#s-{{g}} .card img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}#s-{{g}} .card:after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:40% 0 0;background:linear-gradient(0deg,#000a,transparent 55%)}#s-{{g}} .ct{position:absolute;z-index:1;bottom:0;padding:0 16px 20px;text-align:left}#s-{{g}} .ct:before{content:'';display:block;width:12px;height:2px;background:white;margin-bottom:8px}#s-{{g}} .ct small{display:block;font-size:12px;color:#fffd}#s-{{g}} .ct strong{font:700 21px/1.05 Oswald,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase}#s-{{g}} .controls{position:absolute;z-index:3;left:41%;right:4vw;top:91%;transform:translateY(-50%);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}#s-{{g}} .arrow{width:60px;height:60px;border:1px solid #ffffff8c;border-radius:50%;background:transparent;color:white;font-size:24px}#s-{{g}} .progress{height:1px;flex:1;background:#ffffff59;margin:0 12px}#s-{{g}} .progress i{height:2px;display:block;background:{{block.settings.accent}};transition:width 600ms}#s-{{g}} .count{font:700 48px Oswald,sans-serif}#s-{{g}} .reveal{animation:sr-{{g}} 600ms cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1) both}@keyframes sr-{{g}}{from{transform:translateY(105%)}to{transform:translateY(0)}}#s-{{g}} .fade{animation:sf-{{g}} 600ms cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1) both}@keyframes sf-{{g}}{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}@media(max-width:1024px) and (min-width:750px){#s-{{g}} .cards,#s-{{g}} .controls{left:46%}#s-{{g}} .card{flex-basis:clamp(150px,18vw,190px)}}@media(max-width:749px){#s-{{g}} .copy{top:18%;left:5vw}#s-{{g}} h1{font-size:clamp(40px,11vw,56px)}#s-{{g}} .desc{max-width:90%}#s-{{g}} .cards{left:5vw;right:0;top:auto;bottom:120px;overflow-x:auto;gap:12px;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory}#s-{{g}} .card{flex-basis:132px;scroll-snap-align:start}#s-{{g}} .controls{left:5vw;right:5vw;top:auto;bottom:32px;transform:none}#s-{{g}} .arrow{width:48px;height:48px}#s-{{g}} .count{font-size:32px}}
{% endstyle %}
<destination-slider-{{g}} id="s-{{g}}" {{block.shopify_attributes}}><div class="shade"></div><div class="copy"><div class="dash"></div><div class="loc"></div><h1><span class="line one"></span><span class="line two"></span></h1><p class="desc"></p><div class="actions"><a class="link" href="#">DISCOVER LOCATION</a></div></div><div class="cards"></div><div class="controls"><button class="arrow prev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><div class="progress"><i></i></div><button class="arrow next" aria-label="Next">›</button><span class="count">01</span></div><div hidden class="data">{% for i in (1..6) %}{% liquid
assign k = 'slide_' | append: i | append: '_image'
assign l = 'slide_' | append: i | append: '_location'
assign a = 'slide_' | append: i | append: '_one'
assign b = 'slide_' | append: i | append: '_two'
assign d = 'slide_' | append: i | append: '_desc'
assign u = 'slide_' | append: i | append: '_url'
assign p = block.settings[k]
%}{% if block.settings[a] != blank %}<i data-img="{% if p %}{{p | image_url: width:2400}}{% endif %}" data-card="{% if p %}{{p | image_url: width:600}}{% endif %}" data-loc="{{block.settings[l] | escape}}" data-a="{{block.settings[a] | escape}}" data-b="{{block.settings[b] | escape}}" data-desc="{{block.settings[d] | escape}}" data-url="{{block.settings[u]}}"></i>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div></destination-slider-{{g}}>
<script>(function(){let n='destination-slider-{{g}}';if(customElements.get(n))return;customElements.define(n,class extends HTMLElement{connectedCallback(){this.ds=[...this.querySelectorAll('.data i')];this.idx=0;this.busy=false;this.render();this.querySelector('.next').onclick=()=>this.go(1);this.querySelector('.prev').onclick=()=>this.go(-1);this.querySelector('.cards').onclick=e=>{let c=e.target.closest('.card');if(c)this.go((+c.dataset.idx-this.idx+this.ds.length)%this.ds.length,c)} }go(step,card){if(this.busy||this.ds.length<2)return;this.busy=true;let old=this.querySelector('.bg'),cp=this.querySelector('.copy'),target=(this.idx+step+this.ds.length)%this.ds.length,source=card||this.querySelector('.card'),r=source?.getBoundingClientRect(),s=this.getBoundingClientRect(),layer=document.createElement('img');if(r){layer.className='grow';layer.src=this.ds[target].dataset.img||'';layer.style.setProperty('--t',(r.top-s.top)+'px');layer.style.setProperty('--r',(s.right-r.right)+'px');layer.style.setProperty('--b',(s.bottom-r.bottom)+'px');layer.style.setProperty('--l',(r.left-s.left)+'px');this.appendChild(layer);source.style.visibility='hidden';requestAnimationFrame(()=>layer.classList.add('open'))}if(old)old.style.filter='brightness(.25)';cp.classList.add('dim');this.idx=target;this.shift();setTimeout(()=>{if(old)old.remove();this.render(true);if(layer)layer.remove();this.busy=false},650)}shift(){[...this.querySelectorAll('.card')].forEach((c,i)=>{c.style.transitionDelay=(i*80)+'ms';c.style.transform='translateX(-'+(c.offsetWidth+20)+'px)'})}render(animate){let d=this.ds[this.idx];if(!d)return;let bg=document.createElement('img');bg.className='bg';bg.src=d.dataset.img||'';bg.loading=this.idx?'lazy':'eager';bg.fetchPriority=this.idx?'auto':'high';this.insertBefore(bg,this.querySelector('.shade'));this.querySelector('.loc').textContent=d.dataset.loc;this.querySelector('.one').textContent=d.dataset.a;this.querySelector('.two').textContent=d.dataset.b;this.querySelector('.desc').textContent=d.dataset.desc;let a=this.querySelector('.link');a.href=d.dataset.url||'#';let c=this.querySelector('.cards');c.innerHTML='';for(let j=1;j<this.ds.length;j++){let ix=(this.idx+j)%this.ds.length,x=this.ds[ix],b=document.createElement('button');b.className='card';b.dataset.idx=ix;b.innerHTML='<span class="ct"><small></small><strong></strong></span>';if(x.dataset.card){let im=document.createElement('img');im.src=x.dataset.card;im.srcset=x.dataset.card+' 600w';im.loading='lazy';b.prepend(im)}b.querySelector('small').textContent=x.dataset.loc;b.querySelector('strong').textContent=x.dataset.a+' '+x.dataset.b;c.appendChild(b)}this.querySelector('.count').textContent=String(this.idx+1).padStart(2,'0');this.querySelector('.progress i').style.width=this.idx/this.ds.length*100+'%';if(animate){[...this.querySelectorAll('.dash,.loc,.one,.two,.desc,.actions')].forEach((x,i)=>{x.classList.add(i>3?'fade':'reveal');x.style.animationDelay=(550+i*90)+'ms'})}}})})();</script>
